{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "act18side_level_act18side_03_beg",
  "groupId": "act18side",
  "stageId": "act18side_03",
  "title": "Der Freischütz",
  "storyCode": "LE-3",
  "avgTag": "Before Operation",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/activities/act18side/level_act18side_03_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "f097ca14464b5781ced0657be6092a6c3f9ae3236c58bd4e02f26181c09c3092",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "28_g1_gorgeousstreets"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ebenholz",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Let me see... That's right, this is the place."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kreide",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Isn't this place too ornate to be a music store?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ebenholz",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Of course – this is the best music store in all of Vyseheim. Otherwise, I wouldn't have brought you here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kreide",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But, I didn't apply to enter the Cliffy Patio."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ebenholz",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Those bureaucrats are so inefficient that by the time they process your application, the concert would already be over."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ebenholz",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Plus, even if we do get found out, we'd only be looking at a fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kreide",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I heard that if someone helps an Infected leave the Afterglow, the punishment for them is worse than for the Infected."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ebenholz",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What's there to be afraid of? It'll be fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ebenholz",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Stand up straight and don't act skittish. Just don't let anyone be able to tell and we won't have any issues––"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inexperienced Clerk",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Welcome, Mein Herr. Are you here to pick out an instrument, or...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ebenholz",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Of course. Let's find ourselves a cello first."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inexperienced Clerk",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Very well."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inexperienced Clerk",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Who might this gentleman with you be?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ebenholz",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Him? He's my..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inexperienced Clerk",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Mein Herr, I apologize for my rudeness, but I must remind you that those wearing unauthorized apparel are not allowed into the store."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kreide",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'll go wait outside then."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inexperienced Clerk",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Outside? What exactly are you afraid of, acting all suspicious? Don't tell me you––"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ebenholz",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Do you have any idea upon whom you're casting aspersions? Unauthorized? Suspicious? How dare you use such words to describe a noble! Do you value your job or not?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ebenholz",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "He's simply fallen on hard times, and has no choice but to dress plainly. His clothes are neither damaged nor dirty, so why would he not be allowed inside the store?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inexperienced Clerk",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Excuse my rudeness, but this gentleman's attire does not match the store's required style of..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ebenholz",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Style?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ebenholz",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "My–– cousin, has just suffered a great upheaval. His cello, which he cherished greatly, was destroyed in the turmoil."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ebenholz",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I wanted to bring him here to buy a new cello as a way of expressing my condolences. What right do you have to spout nonsense about 'style?'"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inexperienced Clerk",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I am terribly sorry about this, but it is store policy that all customers must be dressed appropriately."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inexperienced Clerk",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'm sorry, but I cannot allow your companion to enter."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ebenholz",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Fine then!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Ebenholz takes off his cloak and drapes it over Kreide."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ebenholz",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Now that he's wearing the same clothes as me, can he enter? Or, is my cloak somehow part of your inappropriate dress?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ebenholz",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "If I put my cloak back on later, am I also not allowed to enter?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inexperienced Clerk",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Well..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inexperienced Clerk",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I... I'll go ask the manager."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ebenholz",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "This one can't just mind his own business!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kreide",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Here, your coat..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kreide",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ebenholz",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You're welcome."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ebenholz",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It was my idea to bring you here to buy a cello in the first place."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ebenholz",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'm bringing you inside the store one way or another, even if I have to pick a fight with that clerk."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inexperienced Clerk",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We would like to extend our sincerest apologies to both of you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inexperienced Clerk",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The manager will be here shortly, and he will personally show you our instruments."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "28_g2_slumstreets"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hibiscus",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Excuse me, are you busy right now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friendly Infected",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_497_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Oh, it's Hibiscus!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Friendly Infected",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_497_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I've got plenty of time."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hibiscus",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's about your condition..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "28_g1_gorgeousstreets"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kreide",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Phew..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kreide",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I was worried that clerk was going to report us to the authorities..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ebenholz",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Nonsense, it's not like he knew you were an Infected. He just saw your shoddy clothes and took you for a commoner–"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ebenholz",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Tsk tsk... Looks like we forgot something."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kreide",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We did?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ebenholz",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Our suits, of course."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ebenholz",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Surely you don't plan to wear this onstage. It's too unprofessional."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ebenholz",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Let's go. I'll find you the best tailor in all of Vyseheim––"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kreide",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "No, I can't. During the fitting, the Originium crystals would..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ebenholz",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You do have a point."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ebenholz",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "In that case––We'll find the best tailor in the Afterglow. How about it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "28_g7_concerthall_outside"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kreide",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The Sky is blue and fine...♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ebenholz",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Alright, alright."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kreide",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I can't thank you enough. For buying this cello for me, and for helping me order a suit!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ebenholz",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The cello's on me. And we haven't even gotten your clothes yet, nor do we know how they'll look on you. You can save your thanks for later."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kreide",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We'll know by tomorrow afternoon! I'm sure they'll fit just great!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kreide",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "So, thank you!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ebenholz",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Since we left the store, all you've been doing other than humming is thanking me. We've been over it a dozen times."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kreide",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hum, hum."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kreide",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The River murmurs clear...♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ebenholz",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "This tune..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kreide",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What's the matter?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ebenholz",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I think I've heard it before... Or maybe I haven't. Never mind, it's probably just my imagination."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ebenholz",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "By the way, you've studied the cello, so why don't you have one of your own? Did it break?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kreide",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The teacher who taught me how to play did give me a cello, but it didn't take long for someone to mess it up. Even though it's still sitting back at home, by the time I leave this city... I might only be able to bring the bow with me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ebenholz",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Just the bow? What's the purpose of that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kreide",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Seeing the bow is enough to remind me of my teacher."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kreide",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'm afraid that if I were to lose the bow, I might forget my teacher as well."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ebenholz",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Forget? Don't you remember your teacher just fine?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kreide",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Actually, I'm already starting to forget..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kreide",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "My teacher was a nice Sankta lady with very long hair. She dressed plainly, and always had a smile on her face..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kreide",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I used to remember a lot more, as if she were standing right before my eyes... But not anymore."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kreide",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "There are actually a lot of others I've wanted to remember..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kreide",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "So, I need a few keepsakes, to make sure that I won't completely forget."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ebenholz",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Keepsakes, huh...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ebenholz",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What about right now? What do you plan to remember Czerny by?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kreide",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I suppose a signature would do just fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ebenholz",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What about Hibiscus from Rhodes Island?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kreide",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "For Hibiscus, maybe an empty medicine bottle with the Rhodes Island logo?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ebenholz",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Pfft. You're too easy to please."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kreide",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "So long as it helps me remember, the actual object doesn't matter."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ebenholz",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What about me then? It'd be this cello, wouldn't it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kreide",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Maybe something else."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kreide",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The cello from my teacher didn't last very long. If this one also..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ebenholz",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Fair enough."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kreide",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I want to keep a coin that you gave me. Maybe punch a hole through it and wear it as a pendant. That sounds like a pretty good idea."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ebenholz",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Money is how you'll remember me?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kreide",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Eh? Is there something wrong with that? Then, I'll pick something else..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ebenholz",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "No, no, it's a fine idea."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ebenholz",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Shall we head back home and practice?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kreide",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Actually, I was thinking... Why don't we pay a visit to Herr Czerny's first?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ebenholz",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Oh?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ebenholz",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'll pass. It's no secret that he gets all pissy when he sees me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kreide",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'm sure that's just a misunderstanding. It'll get cleared up."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ebenholz",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You've been saying that since the first day we met him."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ebenholz",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Even if it really is some sort of misunderstanding, I think we're well beyond the point of clearing anything up. So yes, I'll pass after all."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kreide",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But Herr Czerny approved of you yesterday, didn't he?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kreide",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "All misunderstandings have to be resolved bit by bit."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ebenholz",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kreide",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Let's go. I want to see him so we can try out the cello you just got for me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kreide",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It'd be a shame if such a wonderful instrument didn't have a knowledgeable audience."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "28_g2_slumstreets"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hibiscus",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Excuse me, are you busy right now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skittish Infected",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_498_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hibiscus? Sorry, but now's not a very good time."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hibiscus",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'd just like you to answer a few questions."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hibiscus",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You're also free to not answer if there's anything you're not comfortable disclosing."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skittish Infected",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_498_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You're not gonna take my blood?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hibiscus",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I wouldn't do that without your consent."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skittish Infected",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_498_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "28_g5_czernyhome"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Czerny",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I don't want to believe it, but this cello isn't something you can find in the Afterglow after one morning of shopping around."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Czerny",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You went to the Cliffy Patio, didn't you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kreide",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I did."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Czerny",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Bold of you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kreide",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Actually... Ebenholz got into an argument with a store clerk just so I could go into the store."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Czerny",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "An argument? Did he think your clothes weren't fancy enough for the Cliffy Patio?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ebenholz",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The clerk said something about 'not being able to enter the store unless dressed appropriately,' but do you see anything wrong with Kreide's attire? They were purposely fault-finding because Kreide was wearing commoner's clothes!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Czerny",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "So you, a noble, have begun to fight for the commoners."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ebenholz",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I did it for Kreide!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ebenholz",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Regardless of whether he's a noble or a commoner, his skill is more than worthy of the instruments inside that store."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ebenholz",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "To deny Kreide entry but to sell those magnificent wares to nobles who needlessly fill their shelves with them would be to treat the finest lumber as firewood."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Czerny",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "(Nods)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Czerny",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I didn't expect to hear those words out of your mouth."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Czerny",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Kreide, go ahead and get acquainted with your new instrument."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Czerny",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'll accompany Ebenholz and have him practice solo for a bit. Let's see if we can change some of his old habits."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ebenholz",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Change my habits...? I dare say––"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kreide",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Yes, Herr Czerny!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kreide",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "(Whispers) See, all misunderstandings have to be resolved bit by bit."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Kreide",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "(Whispers) Herr Czerny's attitude is already changing. The rest is up to you."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "28_g2_slumstreets"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hibiscus",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hello—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rude Infected",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_498_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You that devil?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rude Infected",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_498_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Git outta here. Do you have memory problems or somethin'?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hibiscus",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Sorry to bother you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rude Infected",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_498_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "––Git yer ass back here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hibiscus",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Did you need something?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rude Infected",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_498_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You plannin' to go hide back in your office again, aren't you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hibiscus",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I—"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Coffee Shop Owner",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_485_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You're being a bit unreasonable."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rude Infected",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_498_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Who the hell d'you think you are––"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Coffee Shop Owner",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_485_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You still owe me quite a lot of coffee money, so who do you think I am?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rude Infected",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_498_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Oh, it's you, Herr Biegler... Sorry, didn't notice you there."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hibiscus",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Biegler",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_485_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Don't mention it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Biegler",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_485_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "At the end of the day, the Afterglow is an Infected settlement. It's real lively here, but you'll run into plenty who can't be reasoned with. Best be careful out there."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hibiscus",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Thank you for the reminder."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Biegler",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_485_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Here's my business card, with the phone number of my coffee shop on the front side. If you're ever thirsty, give me a call. We deliver too, real fast."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hibiscus",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Haha..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Biegler",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_485_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "By the way, hasn't Andante always been the one in charge of the Rhodes Island office? Did you just get dispatched over here?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hibiscus",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Actually, I'm here to investigate some strange happenings."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hibiscus",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Oh, Mr. Biegler, regarding your condition––"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Biegler",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_485_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Strange happenings? What kind of strange are you talking about? I haven't heard a thing."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hibiscus",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "So this is what happened..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_ltroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gertrude",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_484_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "How fares the situation?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frivolous Noble",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_492_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Lachmann's plans proceeded spectacularly."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frivolous Noble",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_492_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Graf Urtica's actions were largely within expectations. Though he did cause some hindrance to Lachmann, it was most likely accidental and did not incur any lasting consequences."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gertrude",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_484_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "That's nothing. I never expected Lachmann alone to drive Rhodes Island out of the Afterglow."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frivolous Noble",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_492_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "As for Czerny, he already had to expend most of the goodwill he's earned, not to mention copyrights, just to invite those haughty critics to the concert."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frivolous Noble",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_492_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Word also has it that he held his nose and wrote a glowing recommendation for a noble's album that he held nothing but disdain for."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gertrude",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_484_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "For someone like him, there's no going back now that he's stooped to this level."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gertrude",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_484_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What about the Sankta from a few days ago? If I remember right, when she applied for entry into the city, she said she came from Laterano to immerse herself in Leithanian culture?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frivolous Noble",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_492_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "According to the records, she concluded her tour around Vyseheim and left earlier today for her next destination."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gertrude",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_484_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "So we don't have to worry about her."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gertrude",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_484_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Let's go. We should be on our way to Afterglow Hall."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frivolous Noble",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_492_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But our appointment with Czerny isn't until tonight."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gertrude",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_484_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "There's no shortage of prep work to be done."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gertrude",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_484_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Plus, if that one ever decides to head to Afterglow Hall on a whim, our hired muscle won't be enough to stop him. That's when things get troublesome."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
